[[File:Debug-menu.png|thumb|120px|right|The debug menu in-game]]
[[File:Debug Off 128.png|Closed Debug Icon|thumb|128px|right]]
[[File:Debug On 128.png|Open Debug Icon|thumb|128px|right]]
The '''Debug menu''' is a menu containing many debug tools which can be opened in [[debug mode]] via the [[Plumpabug the Aphid|Plumpa bug]] icon in the left tools bar. The main is separated into two tabs:
* '''Main''' - contains mostly generic tools that users may be interested in
* '''Dev''' - contains mostly developer tools

== Main ==
=== General debuggers ===
A sub-menu with four additional menus:  Game, Blood, Body, Search Mode

==== Game ====
[[File:general-debuggers.png|thumb|300px|right|General debuggers Game Menu]]
This option shows all general game options.
