| Slider that affects the [[endurance]] moodle, increases to 1 naturally.
| min=0<br>max=1
|-
| Fitness
| Slider that affects the [[fitness]] skill. This is a dynamic skill that will increase and decrease depending on the player's actions in 0.2 increments (per level).
| min=-1<br>max=1
