|-
| Panic
| Slider that affects the [[panic]] moodle, decreases to 0 naturally.
| min=0<br>max=100
|-
| Morale
| Slider that decreases to 0 naturally when stress is above 0.5. When stress is below 0.5, morale will instantly become 1.0.
| min=0<br>max=1
|-
| Stress
| Slider that affects the [[stress]] moodle, decreases to 0 naturally.
| min=0<br>max=1
|-
| StressFromCigarettes
| Slider that affects the [[stress]] moodle from [[cigarettes]].
| min=0<br>max=0.51
|-
| TimeSinceLastSmoke
| Slider that affects time since last [[Cigarettes|cigarette]] was smoked.
